{"title":"Career roadmap — School Counsellor","role":"School Counsellor","summary":"A School Counsellor supports students with emotional wellbeing, adjustment, academic concerns, peer relationships, behavioural challenges, career exploration, and family/school coordination. The role combines psychology + counselling skills + child/adolescent development + safeguarding + educational practice.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Clinical / Counselling / Child Psychology"},"about":[{"label":"Important","text":"A B.Sc. in Psychology can provide a foundation for school counselling, but the exact eligibility for counsellor, psychologist, or clinical roles varies by school, employer, state, and professional regulations. A B.Sc. alone should not be treated as equivalent to a regulated clinical-psychology qualification."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus","What to build"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Psychology foundation + supervised school exposure"},{"text":"Developmental psychology, counselling basics, assessment, communication"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"School Counsellor / Student Wellbeing Professional"},{"text":"Individual/group counselling, safeguarding, parent engagement, career guidance"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Counsellor / Wellbeing Lead"},{"text":"Programme design, supervision, crisis protocols, school-wide wellbeing"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Counselling Lead / Student Wellbeing Director / Specialist"},{"text":"Leadership, policy, prevention programmes, training and multidisciplinary coordination"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Psychology foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Introduction to psychology"},{"text":"Biological psychology"},{"text":"Developmental psychology"},{"text":"Social psychology"},{"text":"Cognitive psychology"},{"text":"Personality"},{"text":"Learning and motivation"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Psychological ethics"},{"text":"Academic writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Child-focused foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Early childhood development"},{"text":"Middle childhood"},{"text":"Adolescence"},{"text":"Attachment"},{"text":"Family systems"},{"text":"Peer relationships"},{"text":"Identity development"},{"text":"Academic motivation"},{"text":"Emotional development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Skills to develop"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Empathy"},{"text":"Non-judgmental communication"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Rapport building"},{"text":"Professional boundaries"},{"text":"Confidentiality awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Counselling and school psychology"},{"type":"p","text":"Move from theoretical psychology toward supervised practical skills."},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Counselling"},{"text":"Basic counselling process"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Active listening and questioning"}],[{"text":"Child psychology"},{"text":"Developmental and behavioural understanding"}],[{"text":"Assessment"},{"text":"Screening and observation concepts"}],[{"text":"Behaviour"},{"text":"Behavioural observation and intervention basics"}],[{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Learning difficulties and academic concerns"}],[{"text":"Career"},{"text":"Career exploration and guidance"}],[{"text":"Family"},{"text":"Parent communication"}],[{"text":"Groups"},{"text":"Group facilitation"}],[{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Confidentiality, boundaries and safeguarding"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical exposure"},{"type":"p","text":"Seek supervised experience in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Schools"},{"text":"Child-development centres"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Student wellbeing programmes"},{"text":"Special education settings"},{"text":"Counselling centres"},{"text":"Career-counselling organisations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — School counselling specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the capabilities required in an actual school environment."},{"type":"h","text":"Student concerns"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to understand and appropriately respond to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic stress"},{"text":"Examination anxiety"},{"text":"Peer conflict"},{"text":"Bullying"},{"text":"Social isolation"},{"text":"Family-related difficulties"},{"text":"School adjustment"},{"text":"Motivation problems"},{"text":"Behavioural concerns"},{"text":"Career uncertainty"},{"text":"Emotional distress"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important distinction"},{"type":"p","text":"A school counsellor should not attempt to independently diagnose or treat complex psychiatric conditions outside their qualification and scope."},{"type":"p","text":"Instead:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Identify","Assess appropriately","Support","Document","Refer","Follow up"]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year project"},{"type":"p","text":"Good project topics include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic stress among adolescents"},{"text":"School belonging and student wellbeing"},{"text":"Social media and adolescent wellbeing"},{"text":"Peer relationships and emotional development"},{"text":"Career decision-making among adolescents"},{"text":"Examination anxiety"},{"text":"Parent–child communication"},{"text":"School transition and adjustment"},{"text":"Student resilience"},{"text":"Bullying prevention"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use ethical research practices and appropriate supervision when working with minors."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Child Counselling"},{"text":"Emotional and developmental concerns"}],[{"text":"Adolescent Counselling"},{"text":"Identity, relationships, stress and adjustment"}],[{"text":"Educational Psychology"},{"text":"Learning and academic development"}],[{"text":"Career Counselling"},{"text":"Subject, course and career decisions"}],[{"text":"Behavioural Support"},{"text":"Behavioural intervention and school adjustment"}],[{"text":"Special Education Support"},{"text":"Learning and developmental needs"}],[{"text":"Student Wellbeing"},{"text":"Whole-school wellbeing programmes"}],[{"text":"College Counselling"},{"text":"Older adolescents and young adults"}],[{"text":"School Mental Health"},{"text":"Prevention, awareness and referral"}],[{"text":"SEL"},{"text":"Social-emotional learning programmes"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Highest-value internship environments"},{"type":"h","text":"Schools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Private schools"},{"text":"International schools"},{"text":"CBSE/ICSE schools"},{"text":"Government schools"},{"text":"Residential schools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Child-development settings"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Child-development centres"},{"text":"Special education organisations"},{"text":"Autism-support programmes"},{"text":"Learning-support centres"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Community"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Child-focused NGOs"},{"text":"Youth wellbeing organisations"},{"text":"Community mental-health programmes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship responsibilities"},{"type":"p","text":"Where appropriately supervised:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Student observation"},{"text":"Wellbeing surveys"},{"text":"Classroom observations"},{"text":"Student workshops"},{"text":"Social-emotional learning activities"},{"text":"Career-awareness sessions"},{"text":"Parent communication support"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Referral coordination"},{"text":"Psychoeducation programmes"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certificates should supplement supervised experience, not replace formal psychology training."},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Useful learning"],"rows":[[{"text":"Counselling"},{"text":"Basic counselling skills"}],[{"text":"Child Psychology"},{"text":"Child and adolescent development"}],[{"text":"School Psychology"},{"text":"Educational and school psychology"}],[{"text":"SEL"},{"text":"Social-emotional learning"}],[{"text":"Career Guidance"},{"text":"Career counselling methodology"}],[{"text":"Safeguarding"},{"text":"Child protection and safeguarding"}],[{"text":"Behaviour"},{"text":"Positive behaviour support"}],[{"text":"First Aid"},{"text":"Basic first aid"}],[{"text":"Crisis response"},{"text":"Psychological first aid fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Statistics and research methods"}],[{"text":"Digital"},{"text":"Excel, survey tools and basic data analysis"}]]}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"School Counsellor"},{"text":"Student Counsellor"},{"text":"Student Wellbeing Coordinator"},{"text":"Pastoral Support Officer"},{"text":"Student Support Executive"},{"text":"School Wellbeing Associate"},{"text":"Counselling Assistant"},{"text":"Career Guidance Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Adjacent roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Child Development Associate"},{"text":"Behaviour Support Assistant"},{"text":"Special Education Support Assistant"},{"text":"Student Success Coordinator"},{"text":"Academic Support Coordinator"},{"text":"Youth Programme Coordinator"},{"text":"NGO Child-Welfare Associate"},{"text":"Career Counselling Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With additional postgraduate qualification"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential progression can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Counselling Psychologist"},{"text":"Educational Psychologist"},{"text":"Child Psychologist"},{"text":"School Psychologist"},{"text":"Behavioural Specialist"},{"text":"Mental Health Programme Specialist"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility for regulated or protected professional titles must be checked against the applicable Indian regulations and the specific employer."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For someone specifically targeting school counselling, postgraduate study is strongly recommended."},{"type":"table","header":["PG pathway","Career value"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.A./M.Sc. Counselling Psychology"},{"text":"Counselling-focused roles"}],[{"text":"M.A./M.Sc. Psychology"},{"text":"Broad psychology foundation"}],[{"text":"M.A./M.Sc. Child Psychology"},{"text":"Child/adolescent specialisation"}],[{"text":"M.A./M.Sc. Clinical Psychology"},{"text":"Clinical pathway, subject to applicable regulations"}],[{"text":"M.A./M.Sc. Applied Psychology"},{"text":"Applied psychology roles"}],[{"text":"M.Ed."},{"text":"Education-focused progression"}],[{"text":"M.A. Educational Psychology"},{"text":"Learning and school environments"}],[{"text":"M.A. Guidance & Counselling"},{"text":"School/career counselling"}],[{"text":"M.A. Special Education-related pathways"},{"text":"Learning/developmental support"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended pathway"},{"type":"p","text":"For a student who wants to remain specifically in schools:"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc. Psychology"},{"type":"flow","items":["M.A./M.Sc. Counselling / Educational / Child Psychology","Supervised school counselling experience","School Counsellor","Senior School Counsellor / Wellbeing Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Strong areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"🇬🇧 UK"},{"text":"Counselling, educational psychology, child development"}],[{"text":"🇨🇦 Canada"},{"text":"School counselling, child/youth services"}],[{"text":"🇺🇸 USA"},{"text":"School counselling and school psychology"}],[{"text":"🇦🇺 Australia"},{"text":"Counselling, educational psychology"}],[{"text":"🇳🇿 New Zealand"},{"text":"Child/youth wellbeing and counselling"}],[{"text":"🇮🇪 Ireland"},{"text":"Psychology, counselling and child development"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Important"},{"type":"p","text":"School counselling is often a regulated or credentialed profession abroad. A foreign degree does not automatically grant permission to practise."},{"type":"p","text":"Students should check:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional registration"},{"text":"School-counsellor certification"},{"text":"Supervised practice requirements"},{"text":"Background checks"},{"text":"Child-safety requirements"},{"text":"Visa/work eligibility"},{"text":"Recognition of Indian qualifications"}]}]},{"heading":"Career progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"School pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc. Psychology"},{"type":"h","text":"Counselling / School Wellbeing Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"School Counsellor"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior School Counsellor"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead Counsellor / Student Wellbeing Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Student Wellbeing"},{"type":"h","text":"Director of Student Support / Pastoral Care"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"School Counsellor"},{"type":"flow","items":["Child & Adolescent Specialist","Specialist Counsellor","Clinical/Educational pathway with required qualifications","Senior Specialist / Programme Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"School-wide leadership pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"Counsellor"},{"type":"flow","items":["Wellbeing Coordinator","Student Support Lead","Safeguarding/Wellbeing Programme Lead","Director of Student Wellbeing"]},{"type":"h","text":"High-value capabilities for 2030+"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Social-emotional learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Schools will increasingly need structured programmes around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Self-awareness"},{"text":"Emotional regulation"},{"text":"Empathy"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Decision-making"},{"text":"Resilience"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Digital wellbeing"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social-media behaviour"},{"text":"Cyberbullying"},{"text":"Online identity"},{"text":"Screen use"},{"text":"Digital safety"},{"text":"AI-related student behaviour"},{"text":"Online peer pressure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Career counselling"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong school counsellor can combine psychology with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aptitude"},{"text":"Career interests"},{"text":"Personality"},{"text":"Skills"},{"text":"Academic pathways"},{"text":"Labour-market awareness"},{"text":"Future-of-work trends"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Data-informed student wellbeing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Student surveys"},{"text":"Attendance data"},{"text":"Academic indicators"},{"text":"Wellbeing assessments"},{"text":"Behavioural trends"},{"text":"Intervention outcomes"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Student data must be handled with strong privacy, consent, safeguarding and institutional policies."},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"The traditional model:"},{"type":"h","text":"Student has problem → Counsellor responds"},{"type":"p","text":"will increasingly shift toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Early identification","Prevention","Student wellbeing programmes","Targeted intervention","Referral","Outcome tracking"]},{"type":"p","text":"AI may assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Student-risk pattern detection"},{"text":"Survey analysis"},{"text":"Resource recommendations"},{"text":"Career exploration"},{"text":"Administrative documentation"},{"text":"Psychoeducation content"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But human counselling, trust, safeguarding, empathy, ethical judgment and crisis escalation cannot simply be delegated to an AI system."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Psychology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Developmental psychology"},{"text":"Child & adolescent psychology"},{"text":"Educational psychology"},{"text":"Social psychology"},{"text":"Personality"},{"text":"Learning psychology"},{"text":"Behavioural science"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Counselling"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Rapport"},{"text":"Counselling techniques"},{"text":"Motivational interviewing fundamentals"},{"text":"Solution-focused approaches"},{"text":"Group facilitation"},{"text":"Psychoeducation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"School practice"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Student wellbeing"},{"text":"SEL"},{"text":"Behaviour support"},{"text":"Parent engagement"},{"text":"Teacher collaboration"},{"text":"Safeguarding"},{"text":"Referral systems"},{"text":"Crisis protocols"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Career guidance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Career assessment principles"},{"text":"Academic pathways"},{"text":"Career exploration"},{"text":"Labour-market awareness"},{"text":"Decision-making support"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Survey platforms"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Digital wellbeing tools"},{"text":"Responsible AI use"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Boundaries"},{"text":"Multidisciplinary collaboration"},{"text":"Supervision"},{"text":"Continuous professional development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["Psychology + child development fundamentals","2027–28: Counselling + school-based practical exposure","2028–29: Child/adolescent specialisation + supervised internships","2029–30: PG preparation + school counselling portfolio","2030–32: Counsellor / Student Wellbeing Professional","2032–36: Senior School Counsellor","2036–40: Wellbeing Lead / Student Support Head","2040–46: Director of Student Wellbeing / Specialist / Independent Practice*"],"label":"2026–27:"},{"type":"p","text":"*Subject to the qualifications, registration and professional scope applicable to the specific role and jurisdiction."},{"type":"flow","items":["Psychology degree","postgraduate counselling/educational specialisation","supervised school experience","child safeguarding","career guidance","SEL","strong communication","ethical practice."],"sep":"+","label":"Best employability combination"}]}]}